water that contains no harmful quantity of chlorine, muriatic acid or other chemical used in the treatment or disinfecting of the swimming pool water or in pool cleaning. (Ord. 19496 § 131, 12-21-10; Ord. 17399 § 4, 9-7-99. Code 1995 § 146-454. Formerly 14.90.040.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"8f2689e3-c2d8-5c5e-b03e-0b5e7c66dc02"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.30.030","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.30.030","content_hash":"3c96f1d5082d9921c2ed9d1e315d1310d0120656bd0c7bfdc233ebf2320344ba","heading":null,"ordinal":16,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.30.030:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.30.030:block:16","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.30.030","text":"Cross References: Fire Department, TMC 2.20.030 .","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"22c7fac8-08cc-590a-aa99-be5e06cc4870"}],"root_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.30.030:section","schema":"exais.jurisdiction.structured_content.v1"}